10 REM A WORM BOUNCING ROUND A BOX
20 CLS
30 FOR I=0 TO 127: PLOT I,0: PLOT I,61: NEXT I
40 FOR I=1 TO 60: PLOT 0,I: PLOT 127,I: NEXT I
50 X=20: Y=10: U=2: V=1: L=24: K=0
60 FOR I=0 TO L-1: @(I)=X: @(I+L)=Y: NEXT I
70 UNPLOT @(K),@(K+L)
80 X=X+U: Y=Y+V: PLOT X,Y: @(K)=X: @(K+L)=Y
90 K=K+1: IF K=L THEN K=0
100 IF X<3 THEN U=2
110 IF X>125 THEN U=-2
120 IF Y<2 THEN V=1
130 IF Y>59 THEN V=-1
140 GOTO 70
